	(text_box "Description:\nUART0 on the SOM is reserved for UART-FTDI usage. The default BSP configures the SOM to use UART0 for debugging, this allows the user to be able to use UART to send and recieve commands and telemetry with the SOM.\nThe chip below facilitates UART to FTDI translation so that the end user can utilize a serial port on a seperate machine to interface directly.\nThis design and chip are provided by Phytec."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 222.758 253.492 0)
		(size 71.882 25.908)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
